-- Opsi 1: Soft delete (RECOMMENDED untuk WH PPIC)
-- Jangan hapus, tapi tandai tidak aktif
UPDATE supplier SET is_active = FALSE
WHERE id_supplier = 1;

-- Opsi 2: Hapus anaknya dulu, baru induknya
DELETE FROM barang WHERE id_supplier = 1;
DELETE FROM supplier WHERE id_supplier = 1;

-- Opsi 3: Pakai CASCADE saat bikin tabel
-- (otomatis hapus barang kalau supplier dihapus)
FOREIGN KEY (id_supplier) REFERENCES supplier(id_supplier)
ON DELETE CASCADE  -- hati-hati pakai ini!


------------------------
Untuk sistem WH PPIC, hampir tidak pernah hard delete! Data transaksi harus tersimpan untuk audit. Selalu pakai soft delete (is_active = FALSE).

